## Frequently asked questions

**How much does a website cost in Pontypridd?**

A one-page WordPress website starts from £199, a multi-page WordPress website from £600, an ecommerce website from £800, and a pay-monthly website from £20 a month. All prices include VAT. The worked examples are in [how much web design costs in Cardiff](/blog/how-much-does-web-design-cost-in-cardiff/).

**Do you have an office in Pontypridd?**

No. NC Digital is based in Merthyr Tydfil. Pontypridd projects are run remotely, and we can meet in person in the area when that helps. You still work directly with the person building the site.

**Which places around Pontypridd can the website cover?**

The usual set is Pontypridd itself, Treforest, Glyntaff, Rhydyfelin, Hawthorn, Church Village, Llantwit Fardre, Beddau, Llantrisant, Talbot Green, Tonyrefail, Ynysybwl and Abercynon. We only write pages for places you actually serve.

**Can you build an online shop as well as a brochure site?**

Yes. Brochure and service sites are the web design work on this page. A shop on Shopify, WooCommerce or SureCart starts from £800 and is described on [ecommerce web design Pontypridd](/ecommerce-web-design-pontypridd/).

**Is this the same page as your Cardiff web design service?**

No. [Web design Cardiff](/web-design-cardiff/) is for Cardiff and the Vale. This page is for Pontypridd and the lower Taff. The prices match, because they are the same company, but the pages, the towns and the searches are planned separately.
